  "content": "\n\n<p><span><strong>Create: Oxidized&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>這是 Create 的擴充模組，新增了銅氧化配方。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/860/oxidized_logo.png\" alt=\"Create: Oxidized 標誌\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>內容：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>所有銅製建築方塊的滴漏配方</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/859/oxidized_recipes.png\" alt=\"一組配方集合\" width=\"782\" height=\"333\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>何時推出 1.xx 版本？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>目前僅支援 1.20.1、1.19.2 與 1.18.2，我們沒有計畫為舊版本開發此模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSieyva\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f145a138-ea20-40c4-8c87-33fe627bd905.webp\" alt=\"使用代碼 Sieyva 在 Bisect Hosting 享 25% 折扣\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></span></p>",
